%% archify:artifact sequence
%% archify:elements act-agent, cmp-cli, cmp-reverse-pipeline, ext-git, flow-reverse-validate
%% archify:relationships rel-cli-reverse, rel-reverse-git
%% archify:note Ordered from validateBundle and freezeBundle in archify/reverse/bundle.mjs.
sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent
    participant CLI
    participant Pipeline
    participant Git

    Agent->>CLI: reverse validate <docs> --repo-root <repository>
    CLI->>Pipeline: validateBundle(docsRoot, repoRoot)
    Pipeline->>Git: resolve pinned revision and evidence blobs
    Git-->>Pipeline: file contents or missing-object failure
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: parse Mermaid, OpenAPI, JSON, links, secrets
    Pipeline-->>CLI: diagnostics, coverage, unknowns
    CLI-->>Agent: receipt; non-zero exit while errors remain
    Agent->>CLI: reverse freeze <docs> --repo-root <repository>
    CLI->>Pipeline: freezeBundle writes manifest.json with SHA-256 per artifact
    Pipeline-->>Agent: frozen manifest or refusal
